  "limitations": [
    "The past-start condition is qualitative; no concrete block.timestamp or startTimestamp value is given.",
    "The impact is formalized as a post-creation state (full fee paid with non-distributing campaign) rather than a numeric fee amount, since no fee magnitude is stated.",
    "The temporal_order pattern expresses the intent's startTimestamp >= block.timestamp requirement; the impact's fee/non-distribution state is captured in impact_context_terms.",
    "The impact's 'can never distribute rewards' aspect is represented only via the fully-elapsed creation state; the distributor's actual ignoring behavior is described as possible, not established.",
    "No unauthorized-caller condition is asserted, so the rule does not constrain caller authorization."
  ]
